OL,3,GNEWSACrocodile attack suspect has bail
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was arrested after a
OL,7,Fthree-year-old boy was seriously
OL,8,Finjured in a crocodile enclosure is
OL,9,Fstill on bail.
OL,11,FThe boy was visiting Johnsons of Old
OL,12,FHurst near Huntingdon, Cambridgeshire,
OL,13,Fwith his family on 18 June, when he
OL,14,Fended up in the enclosure and was
OL,15,Fattacked by at least one of the
OL,16,Freptiles.
OL,18,FA 30-year-old man from Norfolk was
OL,19,Farrested at the time on suspicion of
OL,20,Fattempted murder and was bailed until
OL,21,F18 September after being assessed as
OL,22,Fnot "fit for interview".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
