OL,3,GNEWSACrocodile attack suspect has bail
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson confirmed the
OL,7,Findividual, who was not known to the
OL,8,Fchild, had been rebailed until 17
OL,9,FDecember.
